{
  "_comment": "Which URLs search engines may index. publicPages = indexable + sitemap. privatePrefixes = signed-in app pages: noindex header (next.config.js) and disallowed in robots.txt. noindexOnly = pages reachable from public links or emails (auth pages, invitations, shared results): noindex header only, NOT disallowed, so crawlers can fetch them and see the noindex. The Journal (/blog, articles, topic pages) is added by app/sitemap.ts from content/blog: only public articles, topic pages once they are indexable.",
